\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时爆发；完整极化曲线呈活化-混合-传质三段式，是所有储能器件选工作点的依据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"传质与极化","id":"传质与极化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"扩散层与浓度梯度","id":"扩散层与浓度梯度"},{"level":2,"text":"极限扩散电流","id":"极限扩散电流"},{"level":2,"text":"浓差过电位","id":"浓差过电位"},{"level":2,"text":"极化曲线：三段式控制","id":"极化曲线-三段式控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电极反应动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/kinetics/electrode-kinetics"},"next":{"title":"一次与二次电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/primary-secondary"}}